  "info": {
    "title": "Sigillon CLI",
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "description": "Command line tool for Sigillon, an independent Microsoft Word layout and rendering engine for .NET. Install it with \"dotnet tool install --global Sigillon.Cli\" and convert a document with \"sigillon render input.docx output.pdf\", or render many at once with \"sigillon render --batch list.txt --out-dir out\". No Word install, no automation, Linux-first."
  },
